  "printed_text": [
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:0c8da73597ae74a7c7ccac06deca49b8b7efe1a919a5d0f5239c246b95243be4",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 0,
      "confidence": 0.883239,
      "text": "(25) (本小题 10 分)"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:e0f65c40e2127464f0f7734d9e4614f69df0a3147f9665c770d9e08df7de4722",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "confidence": 0.97245,
      "text": "已知抛物线y=-x2+bx+c(b,c为常数,c>1)的顶点为P,与x轴相交于A,B"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:e8d4c8492dc06d1c49ff52caf799410a9deedc8cfbd2565899ab91e324f498d1",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "confidence": 0.992269,
      "text": "两点(点A在点B的左侧),与y轴相交于点C,对称轴与x轴相交于点M,点E在对"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:a6824387b05b12f05f9a520f30c66e6b602470ddcceed56ebdbb65058e7ef41e",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "confidence": 0.989759,
      "text": "称轴上,以AE为边的正方形AEKG的顶点G在x轴下方."
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:48901e178803e1ff401a934e4c74319e74b578eae0addfb9969d067abfed7997",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "confidence": 0.922379,
      "text": "(I)若b=-2,c=3."
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:65ad932a15f5f99b3bec3d9a6d0d5b88cfd5c2c0727af79bd68928611dba7029",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "confidence": 0.99226,
      "text": "1求点P和点A的坐标:"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:4119b091e50b3ea30852a3bec059081176e85cb26a7b4558be1938b69f056454",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "confidence": 0.99067,
      "text": "2当点G在抛物线上时,求点E的坐标:"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:03f6834b3c1f1fab00f12576795e463620f17fca04ab9e377ed1a701a493c8d2",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "confidence": 0.960172,
      "text": "(II)若点A的坐标为(-c,O),点F是AE的中点,对角线AK和EG相交于点H,"
    },
    {
      "observation_id": "observation:text:74a0632e2b8b4651a74ad861e9423a7ed9e959ad241880eca3049035e20f396e",
      "page_id": "page_1",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "confidence": 0.992946,
      "text": "当HF+FM+MG取得最小值为3√5时,求点E的坐标."
    }
  ],
